      tldr: 'In Dallas, the average family spends $163 a visit on house cleaning (Angi), and Thumbtack puts hiring a pro in Dallas at $181–$322. By the hour, Angi puts Dallas at about $50 an hour, ranging $25–$75, while Care.com’s listed cleaners average $21.61 an hour in Dallas and $19.89 an hour in Fort Worth. A standard clean from a Dallas company runs $140–$280, a deep clean $220–$440, and a move-out clean $350–$600 or more (Dallas Maids).',
