      tldr: 'In Boise, pressure washing starts at $199 for a single service — house washing, concrete cleaning, or deck and fence cleaning all start there at Window Genie of Boise. A full house wash runs $400 to $700 for a 1,500 to 2,000 sq ft house, about $500 on average (HomeBlue, Boise). A standard driveway in Boise runs $150 to $270, about $210 on average.',
