      excerpt: 'Mobile detailing in Omaha runs $275 for a full detail on a sedan and $339–$399 for an SUV or truck, with exterior-only from $99 and interior-only from $170 — local prices, what drives quotes in the metro, and how to pay less.',
      metaDescription: 'Mobile detailing in Omaha: full detail $275 sedan, $339–$399 SUV/truck; exterior from $99, interior from $170. Local prices, ways to save.',
