      category: 'Deep cleaning',
      excerpt: 'Deep cleaning in Omaha runs $240–$450 or more for an average home, with a 2,000 sq ft home at $300–$480 and custom work at $45–$65 per labor hour — local prices, what drives quotes in the metro, and how to pay less.',
      metaDescription: 'Deep cleaning in Omaha: $240–$450+ for an average home, $300–$480 for 2,000 sq ft, $45–$65 per labor hour. Local prices, ways to save.',
