      excerpt: 'Mobile detailing in Portland runs $240 for a full detail at one mobile operator and $250–$350 by size at another, with interior-only work at $150–$250 — local prices, what drives quotes in the metro, and how to pay less.',
      metaDescription: 'Mobile detailing in Portland: full detail $240–$350, interior-only $150–$250. Local operator prices, rain and sap factors, ways to pay less.',
