      tldr: 'In Denver, pressure washing a house averages $295 on Angi, with most homes at $170 to $420. HomeBlue\'s Denver guide puts the same job higher — about $600 on average, $400 to $700 for a 1,500 to 2,000 sq ft house. A driveway averages about $230 on HomeBlue, $160 to $290 for a standard 40 x 20 ft driveway. Angi puts Denver about 5% under the national average. Add tax — Denver\'s rate is 9.15%, about $25 on a typical job.',
